      121     run proc-alt-shift-f3 in this-procedure .
      122   end.
      123   on alt-shift-f4 anywhere do:
      124     run proc-alt-shift-f4 in this-procedure.
      125   end.
      126   on alt-f1 anywhere do:
      127     run proc-alt-f1 in this-procedure .
